Package: mitranet-gateway-monitor
Version: 1.0.2-1~deb13u1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: MitraNet Core Team <support@mitranet.id>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.13), iputils-ping | fping, systemd
Description: MitraNet Gateway & Interface Latency Health Monitor
 MitraNet Rinjani 1.0.2 native gateway monitoring daemon.
 Replaces legacy BSD dpinger with an async, low-overhead ICMP/ARP
 probing daemon reporting gateway latency, jitter, packet loss,
 and triggering routing failover via systemd.
